  "worked_solution": "We count the number of rhombuses. We see that there are $2$ rhombuses.\n\nWe count the number of triangles. We see that there are $3$ triangles.\n\nHence, the ratio of rhombuses to triangles is $\\frac{2}{3}.$\n\nSo the missing number is $3.$",
